    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing a Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud Text-to-Speech. My next step will be to integrate the provider-specific code within the `synthesize_text.py` file, so the functionality can be specifically identified.\n\n\n**Defining the Implementation**\n\nI'm now focusing on the Python file itself. The structure is becoming clearer: `synthesize_text.py` will encapsulate the Google Cloud Text-to-Speech integration. I plan to incorporate the client library directly within this file, including all imports and client initializations to solidify its specific function.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789862661243,
          "start": 1789862658254
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc20c0ce0014gKc15tvuJ08id",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc20bbc9001Xb7m0HcojZC2R1",
      "session_id": "ses_f43df44baffe6IGsD7goaDk31x",
